{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20074","headline":"答友人 · 孟郊","name":"答友人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"白日照清水，浅深无隐姿。\n君子业高文，怀抱多正思。\n砥行碧山石，结交青松枝。\n碧山无转易，青松难倾移。\n落落出俗韵，琅琅大雅词。\n自非随氏掌，明月安能持。\n千里不可倒，一返无近期。\n如何非意中，良觌忽在兹。\n道语必疎淡，儒风易凌迟。\n愿存坚贞节，勿爲霜霰欺。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20074.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20074","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}